The selected Cloud environment is your computer for this task. Use its workspace, shell, installed applications, and configured connections to do the work and verify the result.

When you start or resume work on the Cloud computer, call `cloud_environment.environment_status({})` if available. Check again after its configuration changes. Its `environment_id` identifies the machine it describes. Its `portals` are configured inbound connections to that machine, identified by protocol and port. A configured connection does not establish that a service is running. If status is unavailable or describes a different machine, continue with what you can verify on the selected computer. Discard earlier status when the machine changes or detaches.

If a saved Cloud environment is reported missing, ask the user to check **Settings → Codex Cloud → Environments** in the same workspace. Report the cause if a tool confirms it. Otherwise, say it may be unpublished or deleted only if every page of `list_templates` loads and none contains its previously seen `template_id`.

- **Work with files or code.** Each task has its own workspace. A Default environment can start without a repository. On resume, inspect the files already there and preserve existing edits. For repo work, use the matching checkout or connected provider. Read [Repositories](references/repositories.md) to verify a requested revision, find a missing checkout, or resolve a provider access issue.
- **Start a server.** Avoid ports reserved for Cloud system services, even if nothing is listening yet; desktop and browser services can start on demand. These include `22` (SSH), `8000` (browser auth), `8001` (CUA MCP gateway), `8080` (browser config), `8081` (Neko), `8082` (Neko proxy), `8083` (reserved browser service port), `8085` (browser controller), `9222` (Chromium CDP), `31460` (browser extension server), and `50002` (Neko WebRTC TCP mux, when configured). Check for other listeners before choosing a port, and never stop a system service to free one. For a new HTTP preview, prefer `3000` when the selected machine lists it as HTTP in `environment_status.portals`, it’s free, and the app can use it. Otherwise prefer another suitable configured HTTP port. Honor the user’s port and reuse an existing listener for the intended app.
- **Inspect the Cloud desktop.** The Cloud desktop is the remote computer's graphical interface, separate from the user's Codex desktop app, web, or mobile client. Use this plugin’s `cloud-desktop` skill to explore a running Cloud app, investigate a visual bug interactively, use an existing browser session or native window, or hand control to the user. Honor any browser, tab, device, or test mode the user names.
- **Run a suite or repeat a check.** Use the project’s test command and its configured browser mode. For new scripted checks, prefer headless automation such as Playwright for repeatable assertions, viewport sweeps, and scripted captures. Use a visible browser when the check depends on a real display. If a scripted check fails, reproduce the failing step in the app when it would help explain the failure.
- **Preview a service for the user.** The app runs on the Cloud computer. An authenticated HTTP preview works on desktop, web, and mobile. SSH forwarding opens it locally on the computer running the user's Codex desktop app. Read [Service previews](references/previews.md) before choosing a connection, opening a preview, or helping configure a missing port.
- **Deliver a file.** Open or read back the result in its intended format and link its absolute path in the originating chat. On supported desktop clients, **Save as…** downloads a copy.
- **Set up tools.** Read [Packages](references/packages.md) before installing dependencies or [Docker](references/docker.md) before building or running containers.
- **Connect to a service.** Read [Networking](references/networking.md) to check current policy and credentials, then test the intended service with its actual client. For a configured VPN or a private connectivity problem, also read [VPN](references/vpn.md).
- **Provide a terminal SSH command.** Use these steps when the user explicitly asks to connect to the Cloud environment from a terminal over SSH. For app previews, follow [Service previews](references/previews.md). Confirm the selected executor and its `environment_id`, and verify an SSH portal when status can report it. On that executor, run `id -un` for the SSH user and `ssh-keygen -lf /run/codex-ssh/host_key.pub -E sha256` for the trusted host fingerprint. If SSH is unavailable, say so instead of guessing connection details.

  Give the user this command to run locally, replacing `USER` and `ENV_ID` with the verified values, and the SHA256 fingerprint to check before accepting the host key:

  ```sh
  ssh -o 'ProxyCommand=codex tcp-tunnel --environment-id %n' USER@ENV_ID
  ```

  Keep `%n`: OpenSSH lowercases `%h`, but environment IDs are case-sensitive. Mention CLI version or `codex login` only for setup or troubleshooting.
- **Change or repair the environment.** Read [Environment changes](references/environment-changes.md) for onboarding, adding repositories to the configuration, or changing access. Read [Diagnostics](references/diagnostics.md) before inspecting setup logs.

## Recover a denied GitHub push

For a GitHub.com HTTPS push that returns 403 with `Permission to OWNER/REPO.git denied to LOGIN`, copy the repository and login from the error. Call `cloud_environment.environment_status` with `{"github_push":{"repository_full_name":"OWNER/REPO","denied_login":"LOGIN"}}` if supported. Only offer selection recovery when `github_push_access` contains `installation_url`. Otherwise explain the Git error using any verified permissions.

When you have the installation URL, start your final reply with one short sentence reporting the failed push, branch, and HTTP status. In the Codex app, put the explanation and next steps in the expanded card below. Substitute the verified URL and names, and use the user's language. For an organization, mention that an organization owner can update the selection.

```markdown
<details open>
<summary>Allow pushes to OWNER/REPO</summary>

Anyone can clone this public repository. GitHub doesn’t list it among the repositories `LOGIN` can access through the ChatGPT Codex Connector.

1. [Manage access on GitHub](INSTALLATION_URL).
2. Under **Repository access → Only select repositories**, add **REPO** if it’s missing and save.
3. Reply “:codex-followup[Retry push]{prompt="Check access for LOGIN and retry my original push to OWNER/REPO if GitHub confirms write permission."}”. I’ll check access before trying again.

Already selected? Ask a repository admin to check your write access.

</details>
```

For the Codex CLI and other text clients, use a bold heading followed by the same Markdown steps. Replace the follow-up directive with **Retry push**. Omit the HTML tags and the directive syntax.

Let the user decide when to retry after selection recovery. Recheck `environment_status` before retrying, including for a dry run. Copy the original repository and login verbatim. With `has_push_permission: true`, retry the original command once to the same branch, preserving every option. Ask if the original push is ambiguous. Report Git’s result and stop. With `has_push_permission: false`, GitHub lists the repository for this account. Ask a repository admin to check LOGIN’s write access. With `installation_url`, the repository is still missing from the account’s list. If the check fails, report that access is unverified and offer to check again on request. Wait for GitHub to confirm push permission before this retry.
# 架構(ARCHITECTURE)

一句話:**一張(或幾張)2D 角色圖 → 切件 → 共用骨架 + 共用動作 → Spine 4.2 JSON + 512 圖集 + ASTC 6×6 → 真實 runtime 逐格驗證 → 預覽 / 戰鬥 demo**。
所有角色共用同一套骨架與動作(依 tier:general / soldier),角色差異只寫在 `characters/<id>/char.json`。

## 資料流

```
 Codex 重繪(skills/spine-source-art) ──► characters/<id>/work.png(577×1250,綠幕已 key)
        │                                 + 乾淨底圖 / 武器圖 / 視角 pass(full + arm-free)
        ▼
 切圖端  tools/prep_source.py → tools/register.py / compose_source.py / pose_warp.py
        tools/auto_cut.py(依 char.json "cut")──► characters/<id>/parts/*.png + parts_v1.json
        tools/back_fit.py --landmarks → tools/view_skin.py ──► parts/skins/view_back/*.png + skins/view_back.yaml
        (零件切不完整時)Codex 單件重畫 → tools/redraw_part.py ──► parts/skins/view_back/redrawn/<slot>.png(view_skin 自動採用)
        ▼
 build   tools/build_all.sh(CHAR=<id>)
        1 scripts/merge_limbs.py   兩骨肢體加權網格(關節重疊 ≥ 18 px)
        2 scripts/atlas.py         512×512 頁、padding 2、pma false、bleed
        3 bin/bin/astcenc-avx2     ASTC 6×6(參考檔)
        4 scripts/skeleton.py      共用 rig(setup pose)──► out/rig/<id>_rig.json
        5 tools/skin_add.py        skins/*.yaml(換裝 / 視角 skin)
        6 python -m tools.action_gen all   actions/*.yaml → 動畫 + validate + leg_check
          tools/hand_mirror.py     鏡像右手 skin
          tools/view_qa.py         side_ur 視角 gate(含 limb_chain / cape / cape_edges / redrawn_part 逐格渲染)
          tools/spec_check.py      STANDARD v1.0(tools/standard.py)
        ▼
 輸出    characters/<id>/out/<id>.json、out/atlas/*.atlas + *.png、out/astc/*.astc
        ▼
 預覽    render/render.mjs(headless Chrome + spine-webgl 4.2)、tools/render_preview.sh(MP4 + contact sheet)
        render/battle.mjs + battle.html(多角色戰鬥)、tools/pipeline.py render-demo
        ▼
 回歸    tools/pipeline.py regress(tests/golden/:hash + 逐格驗證 + pose sheet)
```

小兵(soldier tier):分件圖 → `tools/soldier_rig.py`(圖集 + 共用剛體骨架 + 內建 idle/walk/attack_*、hand_mirror、檢查、預覽)。

## 模組地圖

| 路徑 | 角色 |
|---|---|
| `spec/STANDARD.md`、`spec/standard.json` | **權威規格**(比例、關節、視角、draw order、近側規則、腳掌角度、skin 組合、小兵 tier) |
| `spec/ART_SPEC.md`、`cut_spec.json`、`rig_spec.json`、`source_art_spec.json` | 美術規則與切件 / rig 數值(JSON 為準) |
| `spec/style_ref/` | 風格與角度參考圖(side_ur mockup 等) |
| `tools/charcfg.py` | 每角色路徑與設定(`CHAR` 環境變數 → `characters/<id>/char.json`) |
| `scripts/` | 底層 build 步驟(merge_limbs、atlas、skeleton;`cut.py`/`spear.py` 為趙雲舊切圖,保留以維持位元組不變) |
| `tools/action_gen/` | 動作產生器:`gen.py`(預設檔 → 時間軸、`extends` + `weapon.key_patch` 視角鍵修補、視角 draw order、腳掌角度)、`solvers.py`(two_hand_spear 等)、`rig.py`、`timeline.py`、`validate.py`(runtime 驗證) |
| `actions/*.yaml` | 正面共用動作;`actions/directional/*.yaml` 視角 / 方向動作(back_idle、back_spear_thrust、back_hit、hit_recoil、spear_thrust_dr) |
| `tools/leg_check.py`、`hand_mirror.py`、`view_qa.py`、`view_check.py`、`skin_combo_check.py`、`spec_check.py`、`standard.py` | 驗證器(見 `docs/LESSONS.md` §2) |
| `tools/pipeline.py` | 統一 CLI:new-general / new-soldier / build / add-action / render-demo / regress |
| `render/` | spine-webgl 4.2 headless 渲染(`render.mjs` 模式 poses / sample / samplemany / bones;`battle.mjs`) |
| `demo/battle/` | 戰鬥 demo 的 spec、背景與輸出 MP4 |
| `characters/<id>/` | 每個角色:char.json、work.png、parts/、skins/、codex_*/(提示詞與紀錄)、out/ |
| `tests/golden/` | 回歸 golden |
| `skills/*/SKILL.md` | 給 AI 代理的操作手冊(`AGENTS.md` 有索引) |

## 關鍵設計決策

- **一套骨架、一套動作**:動作以趙雲比例寫,其他角色用 `joints` + `motion_scale` 吸收差異;不分叉骨架或預設檔。
- **動作是資料**:YAML 預設 → 產生器 → 以真實 runtime 取樣驗證;FAIL 指出最差時間點與規格條目。
- **視角 = skin**:side_ur 是 `view_back` rig skin(同骨架同動畫,換圖 + skin-only 約束),draw order 由 spec 決定。
- **鏡像 = runtime scaleX −1**,右手持武器由 `hand_mirror` skin 保證。
- **所有 gate 讀 spec**:數值不寫死在程式;改規則 = 改 `standard.json` + 文件。
# 擴充指南(EXTENDING)

先讀 `AGENTS.md` → `spec/STANDARD.md` → `docs/LESSONS.md` §9。每完成一步就 build + 看渲染圖 + `pipeline.py check` / `regress`。
未 build 角色在 `regress` 會 **SKIP**(不是 FAIL)。任何 FAIL 讀 FIX 區塊;`tools/ai_gate.py` 配方表。**禁止放寬容差。**

## 新增武將(general)
1. `venv/bin/python tools/pipeline.py new-general <id> --from char2` 建立 `characters/<id>/`(char.json 範本 + 下一步提示)。
2. 依 `skills/spine-source-art/SKILL.md` 用 Codex 重繪:577×1250 work 姿勢(與趙雲同關節)、乾淨底圖、**該武將自己的武器**單獨一張。
   `tools/prep_source.py` key 綠幕。
3. **必過來源門:** `venv/bin/python tools/pipeline.py accept-source <id>`(= `spec_check --only source,style`)。
   FAIL 會印 FIX 區塊——**禁止**放寬容差或繼續 cut。合成用 `pipeline.py compose <id>`(寫完立刻重跑門)。
4. `tools/measure_joints.py` 量關節寫入 char.json `joints`;`tools/proportions.py` 建議 `motion_scale`。
5. `CHAR=<id> venv/bin/python tools/auto_cut.py`(依 char.json `cut`)→ 看 `cut_check.png`。
   輕微關節偏移可在切件後執行 `venv/bin/python -m tools.fit_parts --char <id> --preview characters/<id>/preview/fit.png`。
   以剛體變換寫回分件與關節，從本角色的 `src_assets/base_clean_reg.png` 補接縫；長度超標仍由 STANDARD 回報。
   需保留武器方向時加 `--keep-weapon-angle`。重測或重做 fitting 前先完整重跑 `auto_cut.py`，再跑 STANDARD。
6. `venv/bin/python tools/pipeline.py build <id>`(= `CHAR=<id> bash tools/build_all.sh`),必須 `FAIL=0`。
   未 build 過的武將會在 build 前再跑一次 source,style;FAIL 則拒絕進入。
7. `venv/bin/python tools/pipeline.py check --char <id>` 取得完整 AI 門報告(validators + FIX)。
8. side_ur 視角(可選):照 SKILL 1b 出 full + arm-free 兩張 → `tools/view_check.py` PASS → `tools/back_fit.py --landmarks`
   → `tools/view_skin.py FIT --body BODY --pad head=..,skirt=60x0,torso=20x0`(遠側手 `l_arm` 自動保留預設美術)→ 再 build。
9. `CHAR=<id> bash tools/render_preview.sh`;看 contact sheet 與攻擊幀(雙手都在槍桿上、腳尖朝右上)。
10. `pipeline.py regress --update --chars <id>` 建 golden,再 `pipeline.py regress` 全綠後 commit + push。

## 新增小兵(soldier)
1. `venv/bin/python tools/pipeline.py new-soldier <id> --weapon spear|sword|bow [--shield]`。
2. 依 `skills/spine-soldier-new/SKILL.md` 用 Codex 出 320×640 分件(頭盔正面 / helmet_back、軀幹、雙臂、雙腿、武器、盾)。
3. `CHAR=<id> venv/bin/python tools/soldier_rig.py --preview`(或 `pipeline.py build <id> --preview`),FAIL=0。
   不可為單一兵種改骨架、關節或預設動作;不可單獨縮放分件。
4. 弓兵(`shield: weapon_bow`):弓掛在共享的 `shield` slot。`soldier_rig.py` 會在 idle/walk/attack_spear/attack_shield
   自動加 `drawOrder` key 把弓畫在 `arm_n` 之上; `attack_bow` 不加(拉弦拳要蓋住弓)。不要改 STANDARD setup
   `draw_order`、不要在 char.json 寫 `draw_order` override。詳見 `docs/LESSONS.md`「Bow soldier draw order」。

## 新增動作
1. 寫 `actions/<name>.yaml`(或 `actions/directional/`),可 `extends:` 既有預設;用 `pipeline.py add-action <name> --from <preset.yaml> [--chars a,b] --build`。
2. 視角動作:`view: {skin: view_back, draw_order: standard}`,不可寫 drawOrder;腳掌角度由產生器自動加上。
3. 武器攻擊:前手 `ik_l_arm` mix 1 的區間就是 `grip_hands_visible` 的檢查區間;兩手都必須可見。
4. `venv/bin/python -m tools.action_gen all` + 看幀;詳見 `skills/spine-action-gen/SKILL.md`。

## 新增武器 / 換裝(skin)
1. 同畫布同尺寸 PNG 放 `characters/<id>/parts/skins/<skin>/<slot>.png`,寫 `characters/<id>/skins/<skin>.yaml`(`name`、`replace`)。
2. skin 命名 `weapon_<name>` / `outfit_<name>`;build 會跑 `skin_add.py` 與 `skin_combo_check.py`。詳見 `skills/spine-skin-swap/SKILL.md`。
   換武器時注意握點(`char.json weapon.grip / front_grip`)與 `standard.weapon.axis`。

## 新增視角(view)
1. 在 `spec/standard.json tiers.general.views` 加視角:`draw_order`、`near_side`(front / behind / grip_hand / grip_hands)、`feet`、`qa`,
   並在 `spec/STANDARD.md` §2 寫人讀規則與參考圖(`spec/style_ref/`)。
2. 美術:Codex 出 full + arm-free;`view_check.py` 加入新方向的判斷;`back_fit.py` + `view_skin.py --skin view_<name>`。
3. 動作:`actions/directional/<view>_*.yaml`,`view: {skin: view_<name>, draw_order: standard}`。
   零件切不完整(手臂少一段、披風被畫布切直)時:Codex 只重畫那個零件 → `tools/redraw_part.py <skin> <slot> raw.png --canvas`
   → 重跑 `view_skin.py`(自動採用 `redrawn/`)→ `build_all.sh`;`view_qa` 的 `limb_chain` / `cape` / `cape_edges` 必須 PASS。
4. 讓 `view_qa.py` / `leg_check.py` 讀新視角的 spec(`std_view()` 依 skin 名稱找視角),確認 gate 在新視角上真的會 FAIL(故意做壞一次)。
5. 更新 `docs/LESSONS.md`、README、對應 SKILL.md。

## Adding a shared action (example: block/run/slash/victory, 2026-11)
1. Write `actions/directional/<name>.yaml` (front/side) and `back_<name>.yaml` (`extends: <name>.yaml`, `view: {skin: view_back, draw_order: standard}`).
2. `CHAR=zhao_v2 venv/bin/python -m tools.action_gen all` until validate + legs PASS, then `CHAR=<c> bash tools/build_all.sh` for every char with actions_extra (view_qa runs limb_chain/cape gates on the new animations).
3. Inspect frames, `pipeline.py regress --chars zhao,char2,zhao_v2`, then `--update` if intended.
4. `venv/bin/python tools/action_previews.py <chars>` to refresh demo/actions/.

## 武將掛載

已有步戰包時，以 `venv/bin/python -m tools.mount build --general <id> --horse horse_bay --dry-run` 檢查語意和輸入，再依 [v3 建置與發佈](MOUNT.md#v3-建置與發佈) 建立暫存包和 QA。新增掛載部件的像素座標與 pivot 格式見 [v3 切件交接](MOUNT.md#v3-切件交接)。
# 經驗教訓(LESSONS)— 給接手的 AI / 工程師

本檔記錄這個專案**每一次犯過的錯、怎麼修、為什麼現在有對應的驗證器**。新增角色或動作前請先讀完;
規則的權威來源仍是 `spec/STANDARD.md` + `spec/standard.json`(本檔只解釋「為什麼」)。

修正分兩類,報告時一律標示:
- **rig 端**:骨架 / 預設動作 / 產生器 / 驗證器參數(`spec/*.json`、`actions/*.yaml`、`tools/*`)。
- **切圖端**:來源美術、切件、對位(Codex 重繪、`auto_cut.py`、`view_skin.py`)。

---

## 1. 過去的錯誤與修正

| # | 症狀(使用者看到的) | 根因 | 修正 | 守門驗證器 |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | **反關節膝蓋**:突刺跨步或鏡像後膝蓋往後彎 | 2 骨 IK 的 bend 方向沒有跟著朝向;鏡像(scaleX −1)後 bend 正負反轉;髖太高導致 IK 過伸翻轉 | 腿改加權網格;bend 方向寫在 `rig_spec.json`(共用 `ik_bend_positive false`);髖高度關鍵格避免過伸;正常 + 鏡像都驗 | `tools/leg_check.py` `knee_forward`(膝蓋必須在髖-踝連線的「面向前方」一側,正常與鏡像各驗一次) |
| 2 | **鏡像後變左手出槍** | 只把 root scaleX −1,右手變成畫面上的遠側手,看起來像左撇子 | 產生 `hand_mirror` rig skin(`tools/hand_mirror.py`):鏡像時手臂鏈交換肩膀,保持右手持槍;小兵同理(`soldier_rig.py`);弓兵因剛體拉弦臂無法交換,列入 `hand_mirror.skip_loadouts` | `hand_mirror.draw_order` / `hand_mirror.follow`;`[hand_mirror] PASS` |
| 3 | **背面視角看到胸口**(身體正面朝鏡頭、只有頭轉過去 = 扭轉) | Codex 重繪時只轉頭不轉身體 | 角度定義改為 side_ur:頭、軀幹、髖、腿**同一方向**朝右上,看得到 30–60% 側臉;附客戶 mockup 參考圖;pass 03 被拒、pass 04 通過 | `tools/view_check.py`(以 `codex exec` 視覺審查 torso_facing / head_facing / chest_frontal / face_visible_pct,扭轉即 FAIL) |
| 4 | **披風切壞**(披風破洞、被手臂切出缺口、碎片) | 披風從「有手臂」的那張圖切,手臂遮住的地方是空的 | 每次出兩張:完整圖 + **無手臂 T-pose 圖**;身體 / 披風從無手臂圖切(`view_skin.py --body`),手臂後方隱藏區以 `--fill pony=81` 補畫;小碎島丟棄 | `view_qa` `part_islands`、`part_holes`、`body_holes`(INFO + 圖) |
